  "segments": [
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 1,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "Hiro, you asked me to come by—did the museum board decide what to do about the archive?",
      "seconds": 5.52,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/01_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": null,
      "audio_tag": null,
      "starts_at_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 2,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "They did. Your notes led us to the sealed room before the renovation crew touched it, and the board wants to thank you properly.",
      "seconds": 7.2,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/02_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": null,
      "audio_tag": null,
      "starts_at_seconds": 5.88
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 3,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "[burst of delighted laughter] Thank me? I just followed the old floor plans and hoped I wasn't sending everyone into a broom closet.",
      "seconds": 7.68,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/03_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": "laughter",
      "audio_tag": "[burst of delighted laughter]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 13.44
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 4,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "[wide yawn] You found a collection everyone thought was gone. This is a cash award, and there is a letter offering you a research fellowship.",
      "seconds": 9.519,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/04_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": "yawn",
      "audio_tag": "[wide yawn]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 21.48
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 5,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "[sigh of relief] This covers my tuition gap for the semester. I was trying not to panic about that.",
      "seconds": 6.507,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/05_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": "sigh",
      "audio_tag": "[sigh of relief]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 31.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 6,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "[long yawn] I am glad it reached you in time. The board also asked whether you would catalog the collection with us this summer.",
      "seconds": 8.592,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/06_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": "yawn",
      "audio_tag": "[long yawn]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 38.23
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 7,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "[trembling sigh] My grandfather used to bring me here and tell me every locked door had a story behind it. He would have loved this.",
      "seconds": 8.64,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/07_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": "sigh",
      "audio_tag": "[trembling sigh]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 47.18
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 8,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "[warm laughter] Then you already had the right training. We would be lucky to have you on the project.",
      "seconds": 7.16,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/08_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": "laughter",
      "audio_tag": "[warm laughter]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 56.18
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 9,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "[shaky sob] I keep thinking I need to wake up before someone takes the letter back. Yes—yes, I want to do it.",
      "seconds": 9.776,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/09_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": "sob",
      "audio_tag": "[shaky sob]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 63.7
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 10,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "[weary sigh] No one is taking it back. I argued for you because I watched you do the work when everyone else had given up.",
      "seconds": 7.76,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/10_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": "sigh",
      "audio_tag": "[weary sigh]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 73.83
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 11,
      "speaker": "Eisley",
      "text": "[relieved sob] Thank you for seeing me, Hiro. I am going to make this collection worthy of all the people who protected it.",
      "seconds": 9.472,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/11_eisley.mp3",
      "vocalization": "sob",
      "audio_tag": "[relieved sob]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 81.95
    },
    {
      "kind": "gap",
      "seconds": 0.36
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "turn": 12,
      "speaker": "Hiro",
      "text": "[sleepy yawn] Start by celebrating tonight. Tomorrow, after I have slept, we can plan your first day.",
      "seconds": 6.577,
      "path": "soda_scatter/out/lines/soda_2409141/12_hiro.mp3",
      "vocalization": "yawn",
      "audio_tag": "[sleepy yawn]",
      "starts_at_seconds": 91.79
    }
  ],
